<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-ARGENTINA AND PARAGUAY DRAW 1-1 IN COPA AMERICA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ARGENTINA AND PARAGUAY DRAW 1-1 IN COPA AMERICA.</headline>
<dateline>COCHABAMBA, Bolivia 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina and</p>
<p>Paraguay drew 1-1 (halftime 0-0) in a Copa America group A</p>
<p>match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Argentina - Marcello Gallardo (90th minute, penalty)</p>
<p>Paraguay - Jose Luis Chilavert (73, penalty)</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, goals against, points)</p>
<p> Ecuador	  3  2  1  0  4  1   7</p>
<p> Argentina	3  1  2  0  3  1   5</p>
<p> Paraguay	 3  1  1  1  2  3   4</p>
<p> Chile	    3  0  0  3  1  5   0</p>
<p>Note: top two teams in each group plus the two best</p>
<p>third-best teams qualify for the quarter-finals.</p>
<p>Ecuador and Argentina qualify.</p>
</text>
